== Effect ==
* {{dlc|nr}} Upon taking damage, all enemies in the room are [[charm]]ed.
** {{dlc|a+}} It won't trigger if there are less than 2 enemies in the room.
* {{dlc|r}} Enemies are able to damage each other with projectiles. If an enemy is damaged by another enemy, they will attack that enemy instead of Isaac.

== Notes ==
* {{dlc|nr}} This item is extremely strong against the second and third phase of {{E|???}}, as its own eternal flies become charmed and deal massive damage to the boss, often killing it after even just two uses.
* {{dlc|r}} The initial effect only affects projectiles. Enemies will not deal contact damage to each other, unless hit by a projectile, at which point they will deal contact damage to their attacker.
* {{dlc|r}} [[Charm|Charmed]] and [[friendly]] enemies can trigger the item.

