== Trivia ==
* This is a reference to Judas betraying Jesus after the Last Supper, leading to Jesus' death by crucifixion.
* {{dlc|r}} Betrayal's updated behavior bears a similarity to the monster infighting mechanic from the ''Doom'' series, ''Heretic'', and ''Hexen'', which similarly causes enemies struck by another enemy's attack to prioritize attacking that monster over the player character.

